{'symbol': 'MPWR', 'date': '2023-02-08 16:02:00', 'title': 'MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS APPOINTS NEW BOARD MEMBER', 'text': 'KIRKLAND, WASH., FEB. 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS, INC. (“MPS”) (NASDAQ: MPWR), A FABLESS COMPANY WITH A GLOBAL FOOTPRINT THAT PROVIDES HIGH-PERFORMANCE, SEMICONDUCTOR-BASED POWER ELECTRONIC\xa0SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF EILEEN WYNNE TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”) ON FEBRUARY 7, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'MPWR', 'date': '2023-02-08 16:01:00', 'title': 'MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS ANNOUNCES\xa0RESULTS\xa0FOR THE\xa0FOURTH QUARTER AND YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AND AN INCREASE IN QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'KIRKLAND, WASH., FEB. 08, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MONOLITHIC POWER SYSTEMS, INC. (“MPS”) (NASDAQ: MPWR), A FABLESS COMPANY WITH A GLOBAL FOOTPRINT THAT PROVIDES HIGH-PERFORMANCE, SEMICONDUCTOR-BASED POWER ELECTRONIC\xa0SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER AND YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022. THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED AN INCREASE IN THE QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND FROM $0.75 PER SHARE TO $1.00 PER SHARE. THE FIRST QUARTER DIVIDEND OF $1.00 PER SHARE WILL BE PAID ON APRIL 14, 2023 TO ALL STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2023.'}